eline with underwear, cleaning and the aftercare sheet.\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 3–13y videos\"},{\"href\":\"/adult-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Teenagers and adults\",\"title\":\"14+ yrs and adults\",\"price\":\"5 videos\",\"blurb\":\"Preparation, consultation, forceps guided aftercare, applying Vaseline with underwear and the aftercare sheet.\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 14+ yrs and adults videos\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Already had the procedure and something is worrying you?\",\"text\":\"Call the clinic. Follow-up appointments during the healing period are included where needed.\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
